cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ABG-v30 or its benchmark artifact, please cite this repository and the accompanying research report."
title: "ABG-v30: Adaptive Box Subdivision for Budgeted Black-Box Optimization"
version: "1.0"
authors:
  - family-names: "Emam"
    given-names: "Iliya"
abstract: >-
  An exploratory benchmark report for an adaptive box-subdivision
  optimizer evaluated across 33 continuous optimization function families and
  87 deterministic function-dimension tasks. The reported results are descriptive
  and do not establish universal or statistically significant superiority.
keywords:
  - black-box optimization
  - derivative-free optimization
  - global optimization
  - benchmark reproducibility
